{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet your new desktop companion!<br>This <strong>cute and cozy virtual cat pet</strong> lives right on your Windows desktop \u2014 playfully roaming, napping, and interacting with you while you work, browse, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're typing up documents or watching videos, your pet cat keeps you company in a charming <strong>overlay experience</strong> that never gets in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686200/extras/AboutSectionImage01.png?t=1747043144\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adorable desktop overlay cat</strong> that lives outside the game window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feed, pet, and play</strong> with your cat using simple interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Always-on experience</strong> that runs while you do other things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distraction-free \u2014 like a virtual buddy, not a full-screen app.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely <strong>customize</strong> your cat\u2019s look with accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Monitor</strong> support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for anyone who wants a little happiness on their screen at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2757 <strong>Windows OS only</strong>\u2757</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686200?t=1747043144","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686200/46550a843b16c84ed44639fbc4da36e528104b01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747043144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686200/437dc19aecfb95d2ffc729ff0e45b625a449b887/capsu